vestigations will be released over time and are sold separately. Buying one investigation does not entitle you to any other."]}],["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Languages."}]," From 14 November 2026, the book is available in English, French, Spanish, Portuguese and German. Every language is included in the one price: switch between them at any time with the language button at the top of the book, at no extra cost."]}],"$Lc","$Ld","$Le","$Lf","$L10","$L11","$L12","$L13","$L14","$L15","$L16","$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f","$L20","$L21","$L22","$L23","$L24","$L25","$L26","$L27","$L28","$L29","$L2a","$L2b","$L2c"]]}],"$L2d"]}],["$L2e","$L2f"],"$L30"]}],"p":true,"v":"$31"}}]]
