e:["$","p",null,{"children":"Prices are set in US dollars. If you pay in another currency, the amount is converted at the rate shown at checkout before you pay, and that is the amount charged. Your bank may add its own fees for foreign or card payments; those are between you and your bank. A price change never affects an investigation you have already bought."}]
f:["$","h2",null,{"children":"3. Payment"}]
10:["$","p",null,{"children":["Payments are processed by ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"Flutterwave"}],", a payment company licensed by the Central Bank of Nigeria, and may also be processed by other licensed processors such as Paystack. We never see or store your card number, PIN or bank login. You can pay in any of these ways:"]}]
11:["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Card."}]," Visa, Mastercard, American Express, Verve and other major cards, from Nigeria or abroad. Your bank may ask you to confirm the payment with a one-time code."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Bank transfer."}]," For buyers in Nigeria with no card. At checkout the processor gives you a bank account number created for that one payment only. Transfer the ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"exact amount shown"}]," before the timer runs out. The payment is confirmed automatically and your access opens. Do not reuse the account number for another payment, and do not send a different amount; a transfer that does not match is returned by the processor and does not unlock the book."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Apple Pay and bank apps."}]," Where your device or country supports it, you can also pay with Apple Pay, or straight from your banking app in the UK and the EU."]}]]}]
12:["$","p",null,{"children":"A receipt is sent to the email address you give at checkout."}]
13:["$","h2",null,{"children":"4. Your access"}]
14:["$","p",null,{"children":["When your payment is confirmed, your account can open the investigation you bought. If you buy before"," ","20 December 2026",", your access begins on that date, when Part One opens, and each later part opens to you on its release date at no further cost."]}]
15:["$","p",null,{"children":["Your access is ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"for life"}],". If we revise, correct or expand an investigation you own, the revised edition is yours too, at no cost. It stays your copy for as long as ","The Laws of Ruin"," is published."]}]
16:["$","p",null,{"children":"Keep your sign-in details private. Your access is for you alone and may not be shared, sold, lent or transferred. We may suspend an account that is used from an unusual number of people or devices, after first contacting you."}]
17:["$","h2",null,{"children":"5. What you own and what we own"}]
18:["$","p",null,{"children":["Buying an investigation gives you a ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"personal licence to read it"}],". It does not give you ownership of the text, the images, the design or the app. All of these are the property of ","Orion Learning Innovations"," and are protected by the Copyright Act 2022 of Nigeria and by copyright law in every country that is party to the Berne Convention."," ","Orion Learning Innovations"," alone holds the right to copy, share, publish and distribute ","The Laws of Ruin","."]}]
19:["$","div",null,{"className":"nkNtYW_note","children":["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Do not copy the book."}]," You may not screenshot, screen-record, photograph, print, copy, scrape, translate, upload, post, sell or otherwise reproduce or share any part of ","The Laws of Ruin",", in any form, without our written permission. Doing so infringes our copyright. We will remove infringing copies, close the account involved without refund, and take legal action, including a claim for damages."]}]}]
1a:["$","p",null,{"children":["Short quotations, of a few sentences, credited to ","The Laws of Ruin",", are allowed for review, criticism and study, as the law permits."]}]
1b:["$","h2",null,{"children":"6. Refunds"}]
1c:["$","p",null,{"children":["Refunds are covered by our ",["$","$Lb",null,{"href":"/refunds","children":"Refund Policy"}],", which forms part of these terms."]}]
1d:["$","h2",null,{"children":"7. Acceptable use"}]
1e:["$","p",null,{"children":"You agree not to break, probe or get around the app's security or payment, not to use automated tools to access it, and not to use it for anything unlawful. We may suspend or close an account that does."}]
1f:["$","h2",null,{"children":"8. Why the book exists"}]
20:["$","p",null,{"children":["The Laws of Ruin"," is written to educate. Each investigation studies the lives of men who rose to great power and then fell, and draws out the lessons of their rise and their ruin, so that readers can recognise the same patterns in their own work, leadership and lives. It tells these stories to teach, never to celebrate the crimes or cruelty in them."]}]
21:["$","p",null,{"children":"We take care to be accurate, but history is argued and sources disagree. The book is not professional, legal or financial advice. If you find an error, tell us and we will look at it for the next revision."}]
22:["$","h2",null,{"children":"9. Availability"}]
23:["$","p",null,{"children":"We aim to keep the app available at all times but cannot promise it will never be interrupted. If a part's release date has to move, we will tell you in the app and by email. If we ever stop publishing an investigation before all its parts are released, you may ask for a refund of the price you paid."}]
24:["$","h2",null,{"children":"10. Liability"}]
25:["$","p",null,{"children":"Nothing in these terms limits rights you have under the Federal Competition and Consumer Protection Act 2018 or any consumer law that applies to you. Apart from those rights, our total liability to you is limited to the amount you paid for the investigation concerned, and we are not liable for indirect or unforeseeable loss."}]
26:["$","h2",null,{"children":"11. Changes to these terms"}]
27:["$","p",null,{"children":"We may update these terms. The date at the top shows the latest version. A change never takes away an investigation you have already bought. If a change is significant, we will tell you by email before it applies."}]
28:["$","h2",null,{"children":"12. Law and disputes"}]
29:["$","p",null,{"children":"These terms are governed by the laws of the Federal Republic of Nigeria. If you have a complaint, write to us first and we will try to settle it within 14 days. If we cannot, the courts of Lagos State, Nigeria, will decide it. If you live in another country, you keep any right its law gives you to bring a claim where you live."}]
2a:["$","p",null,{"children":"These terms, like the book, may be shown in other languages. If a translation and the English version ever differ, the English version applies."}]
